\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator#Data_members\"><code><i>active_</i></code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span>\n</code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another generator to be moved from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete </div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Iterators previously obtained from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> are not invalidated – they become iterators into <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.\n</p><p>This assignment operator is technically a <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/as_operator\">copy assignment operator</a>, although <code>std::generator</code> is only move assignable.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"coroutine","title":"Coroutine support (C++20)"},{"path":"coroutine/generator","title":"std::generator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::generator<Ref,V,Allocator>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Replaces the contents of the generator object. Equivalent to:"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Complexity"},{"label":"Notes